der with Romania.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/silius-italicus"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/silius-italicus.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Silius Italicus</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Silius Italicus was a Roman senator and poet, consul in 68 CE, who wrote the Punica, an epic in seventeen books on the Second Punic War and the longest surviving Latin…</span></a></li></ul>
